message: "If you use lemo-wake, please cite it as below."
title: "lemo-wake: Wake your image (把你的照片叫醒)"
abstract: "A Claude Code plugin that turns one still image into a ~5 second seamlessly looping animation (MP4, GIF, WebP, WeChat sticker) by reading the picture, taking it apart and re-choreographing it in code. No image generation, no API keys."
type: software
